Slirc — self-hosted Slack on IRC
=================================

Welcome to Slirc. Read along without an account.

#open-chat is open to everyone. Join the conversation, talk about whatever is on
your mind, or just listen for a while.

Enter your email to join. We'll send a sign-in link. Signing in lets you post,
keep your name, and access private rooms and direct messages.

Be kind, be useful, and keep private conversations private.
Docs: https://chat.example.com/docs